    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9935" root="خبط" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُبَاطٌ</span></b>  <i>A certain malady,</i> (K,) <i>like diabolical
possession,</i> or <i>insanity,</i> (S, K,) <i>but not identical
therewith:</i> (S, TA:) the word is also related with
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ح</span> (TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُبَاطٌ</span>.]

